ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790930/6886e77ffafc62c12824e773e177b19bcf0aeed2/ss_6886e77ffafc62c12824e773e177b19bcf0aeed2.600x338.jpg?t=1771614740"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790930/9c5da4384b33495deb1c34a9c93939d62fa41f07/ss_9c5da4384b33495deb1c34a9c93939d62fa41f07.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771614740","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790930/9c5da4384b33495deb1c34a9c93939d62fa41f07/ss_9c5da4384b33495deb1c34a9c93939d62fa41f07.600x338.jpg?t=1771614740"}],"short_description":"Crisol is a survival horror adventure set in a twisted version of Spain. As a soldier captured by religious dogmatism, you must use your own blood as ammunition, without draining to the point of death. Explore the cursed island of Tormentosa, uncover dark secrets, and battle horrifying enemies.","steam_appid":1790930,"support_info":{"email":"support@blumhousegames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://crisolthegame.com"}